{"segment_id": "segment_00024", "start": 720.0, "end": 750.0, "speech": "现在非常有钱了. Next one, 下一个单词跟我一起读一下，叫做 depend. depend 叫做依靠、依赖，它经常是跟 on 放到一起，放到一起去用啊。当然也可以单独出现，叫做 depend on，叫依赖某人或某物。比如说， if I need help, I can always depend on Leo. 说如果我需要帮忙，我总是可以依靠、", "frames": [{"path": "frames/frame_000050.webp", "time": 722.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["胶囊助学计划", "/dI'pend /", "depend v."], "scores": [0.99788, 0.79386, 0.99791], "boxes": [[[1501.0, 49.0], [1822.0, 47.0], [1822.0, 93.0], [1501.0, 95.0]], [[511.0, 76.0], [768.0, 76.0], [768.0, 123.0], [511.0, 123.0]], [[504.0, 129.0], [845.0, 129.0], [845.0, 221.0], [504.0, 221.0]]]}}, {"path": "frames/frame_000051.webp", "time": 727.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["胶囊助学计划", "/dι'pend/", "depend v."], "scores": [0.99899, 0.72803, 0.96916], "boxes": [[[1499.0, 48.0], [1825.0, 45.0], [1825.0, 94.0], [1499.0, 97.0]], [[510.0, 78.0], [769.0, 75.0], [769.0, 122.0], [510.0, 124.0]], [[502.0, 128.0], [846.0, 126.0], [846.0, 220.0], [502.0, 223.0]]]}}, {"path": "frames/frame_000052.webp", "time": 740.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["胶囊助学计划", "/di'pend/", "depend v.", "① depend on", " If I need help,I can always", "depend on Leo."], "scores": [0.99458, 0.83099, 0.99535, 0.9792, 0.95924, 0.99435], "boxes": [[[1503.0, 49.0], [1810.0, 49.0], [1810.0, 94.0], [1503.0, 94.0]], [[510.0, 75.0], [769.0, 75.0], [769.0, 125.0], [510.0, 125.0]], [[503.0, 127.0], [845.0, 125.0], [845.0, 220.0], [503.0, 223.0]], [[507.0, 272.0], [845.0, 274.0], [845.0, 342.0], [507.0, 339.0]], [[567.0, 331.0], [1181.0, 339.0], [1180.0, 404.0], [566.0, 397.0]], [[577.0, 399.0], [956.0, 399.0], [956.0, 463.0], [577.0, 463.0]]]}}], "review_flags": [], "asr_model": "Qwen/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B"}
{"segment_id": "segment_00025", "start": 750.0, "end": 780.0, "speech": "依赖Leo的，对吧？放心来找他。所以您看这个地方，我们之前讲的是主将从现，那在这个地方我就稍微的拓展了一点点，叫做主情从现。主情从现就是主句用的是情态动词，从句还是用一般现在时。那这个呢语法呢，实际上我们要到新概念二册，我把它放到了新概念二册第十六课，我们一口气儿再给大家讲，好吧？啊，各位不妨坚", "frames": [{"path": "frames/frame_000053.webp", "time": 757.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["胶囊助学计划", "/di'pend/", "depend v.", "① depend on", "If I need help, I can always", "depend on Leo."], "scores": [0.99808, 0.83323, 0.97263, 0.99146, 0.96424, 0.9938], "boxes": [[[1502.0, 49.0], [1811.0, 49.0], [1811.0, 94.0], [1502.0, 94.0]], [[510.0, 75.0], [769.0, 75.0], [769.0, 125.0], [510.0, 125.0]], [[504.0, 127.0], [845.0, 127.0], [845.0, 222.0], [504.0, 222.0]], [[507.0, 270.0], [845.0, 272.0], [845.0, 342.0], [507.0, 339.0]], [[566.0, 331.0], [1181.0, 339.0], [1180.0, 404.0], [565.0, 397.0]], [[577.0, 399.0], [956.0, 399.0], [956.0, 463.0], [577.0, 463.0]]]}}], "review_flags": [], "asr_model": "Qwen/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B"}
{"segment_id": "segment_00026", "start": 780.0, "end": 810.0, "speech": "持往下学，continue。那还可以说说这事儿靠你了，it depends on you啊，或者说它其实还有另外一个意思，叫做这事儿取决于你啊，取决于你。注意，就不是依靠于你了，叫做 it depends on you，有点类似于你说了算的感觉，它不完全相同啊。OK， recap，本课最重要的除了单词以外，就是这个公式啊，叫做", "frames": [{"path": "frames/frame_000054.webp", "time": 787.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["胶囊助学计划", "/dI'pend/", "depend v.", "① depend on", " If I need help, I can always", "depend on Leo.", "③ It depends on you."], "scores": [0.9981, 0.76454, 0.99538, 0.95011, 0.94044, 0.99425, 0.9385], "boxes": [[[1502.0, 49.0], [1814.0, 49.0], [1814.0, 94.0], [1502.0, 94.0]], [[510.0, 75.0], [769.0, 75.0], [769.0, 125.0], [510.0, 125.0]], [[503.0, 127.0], [844.0, 125.0], [844.0, 220.0], [503.0, 223.0]], [[507.0, 271.0], [844.0, 274.0], [844.0, 342.0], [507.0, 338.0]], [[566.0, 333.0], [1181.0, 339.0], [1181.0, 404.0], [566.0, 399.0]], [[577.0, 398.0], [960.0, 398.0], [960.0, 462.0], [577.0, 462.0]], [[539.0, 456.0], [1017.0, 464.0], [1016.0, 530.0], [538.0, 523.0]]]}}, {"path": "frames/frame_000055.webp", "time": 803.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["胶囊助学计划", "Recap", "Patterns", "if …..(现),主语will do…(将)", "Grammar", "Words", "Expression"], "scores": [0.99887, 0.99823, 0.9988, 0.79409, 0.99627, 0.99798, 0.99783], "boxes": [[[1500.0, 49.0], [1818.0, 49.0], [1818.0, 94.0], [1500.0, 94.0]], [[117.0, 59.0], [262.0, 66.0], [259.0, 118.0], [114.0, 110.0]], [[151.0, 258.0], [349.0, 262.0], [348.0, 312.0], [150.0, 307.0]], [[418.0, 303.0], [945.0, 303.0], [945.0, 361.0], [418.0, 361.0]], [[137.0, 353.0], [366.0, 357.0], [365.0, 407.0], [136.0, 404.0]], [[167.0, 510.0], [333.0, 512.0], [332.0, 571.0], [166.0, 569.0]], [[118.0, 728.0], [382.0, 728.0], [382.0, 785.0], [118.0, 785.0]]]}}, {"path": "frames/frame_000056.webp", "time": 808.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["胶囊助学计划", "Recap", "Patterns", "&", "if ….(现),主语will do …", "（将）", "Grammar", "Words", "Expression"], "scores": [0.99919, 0.99804, 0.99872, 0.53314, 0.79298, 0.72788, 0.99664, 0.9982, 0.99813], "boxes": [[[1499.0, 47.0], [